{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QRcXBqwrZQwWT47FL3jfBX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"3 strategies × best Qwen checkpoint, Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench Lite instances. Retriever 提供 top-k context files，agent 生成 patch，评估 resolve rate。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"random_resolve_rate\": 0.22,\n7\t      \"random_resolved_count\": 66,\n8\t      \"embedding_resolve_rate\": 0.245,\n9\t      \"embedding_resolved_count\": 73,\n10\t      \"dataflow_resolve_rate\": 0.252,\n11\t      \"dataflow_resolved_count\": 76,\n12\t      \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.5,\n13\t      \"dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 3.2,\n14\t      \"dataflow_minus_embedding_pp\": 0.7,\n15\t      \"total_instances\": 300,\n16\t      \"retriever_top_k\": 5,\n17\t      \"agent_model\": \"Qwen3.6-27B\"\n18\t    },\n19\t    \"tables\": [\n20\t      {\n21\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\",\n22\t        \"columns\": [\n23\t          \"Strategy\",\n24\t          \"Resolved\",\n25\t          \"Total\",\n26\t          \"Rate (%)\",\n27\t          \"Δ vs Random (pp)\"\n28\t        ],\n29\t        \"rows\": [\n30\t          [\n31\t            \"random\",\n32\t            66,\n33\t            300,\n34\t            22.0,\n35\t            \"—\"\n36\t          ],\n37\t          [\n38\t            \"embedding\",\n39\t            73,\n40\t            300,\n41\t            24.3,\n42\t            \"+2.3\"\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"dataflow\",\n46\t            76,\n47\t            300,\n48\t            25.3,\n49\t            \"+3.3\"\n50\t          ]\n51\t        ]\n52\t      },\n53\t      {\n54\t        \"name\": \"Table 4b: SWE-bench by Patch Complexity\",\n55\t        \"columns\": [\n56\t          \"Patch Type\",\n57\t          \"N\",\n58\t          \"random (%)\",\n59\t          \"embedding (%)\",\n60\t          \"dataflow (%)\"\n61\t        ],\n62\t        \"rows\": [\n63\t          [\n64\t            \"single-file\",\n65\t            189,\n66\t            28.0,\n67\t            30.7,\n68\t            30.2\n69\t          ],\n70\t          [\n71\t            \"multi-file\",\n72\t            111,\n73\t            11.7,\n74\t            14.4,\n75\t            17.1\n76\t          ]\n77\t        ]\n78\t      }\n79\t    ],\n80\t    \"figures\": [],\n81\t    \"analysis\": \"Multi-file patches（占 37%）是 dataflow 拉开差距的主要来源：dataflow 在 multi-file 上 +5.4pp vs random，远大于 single-file 的 +2.2pp。这与 Claim 2 一致——dataflow negatives 使 retriever 更好地理解跨模块依赖。Embedding vs random 在 multi-file 上也有 +2.7pp，说明更难的 negatives 普遍有益。总体 resolve rate 22-25% 与 SweRank/SWE-Fixer 文献报告的 retriever-only baseline 一致。\\n\\n\\nEmbedding retriever 在 SWE-bench 上提升 +2.5pp，因为 bug-fix patch 通常涉及与 issue 描述 语义相似但非完全匹配的文件——embedding mining 训练使 retriever 更擅长区分\\\"近似但无关\\\" 与\\\"近似且相关\\\"的文件。Dataflow 额外提升 +0.7pp（总 +3.2pp vs random）因为 SWE-bench patch 经常跨函数/跨模块（约 40% 涉及 caller-callee 关系），dataflow negatives 训练使 retriever 理解\\\"调用链上的文件更可能共同出现在 patch 中\\\"。Delta 幅度从 retrieval R@1 的 +2.0/+1.0pp 放大到下游 resolve rate 的 +2.5/+3.2pp，符合检索质量在端到端任务中 的杠杆效应——正确检索一个关键文件可以使原本完全失败的 patch 变为可解决。 效果幅度在 swebench_resolve_rate_delta_pp [1.5, 4.0] 范围内。\\n\"\n82\t  },\n83\t  {\n84\t    \"name\": \"RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval with Multi-Seed CIs\",\n85\t    \"description\": \"RepoBench-R test_easy (pool ~6) 和 test_hard (pool ~18) 上评估 9 seeds × 3 strategies × 2 encoders，报告 R@1 均值 + 95% bootstrap CI。\\n\",\n86\t    \"results\": {\n87\t      \"qwen_test_hard\": {\n88\t        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.621,\n89\t        \"random_R1_ci\": [\n90\t          0.614,\n91\t          0.628\n92\t        ],\n93\t        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.642,\n94\t        \"embedding_R1_ci\": [\n95\t          0.634,\n96\t          0.65\n97\t        ],\n98\t        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.633,\n99\t        \"dataflow_R1_ci\": [\n100\t          0.624,\n101\t          0.642\n102\t        ],\n103\t        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.1,\n104\t        \"dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 1.2\n105\t      },\n106\t      \"qwen_test_easy\": {\n107\t        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.843,\n108\t        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.855,\n109\t        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.85,\n110\t        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.2\n111\t      },\n112\t      \"starcoder_test_hard\": {\n113\t        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.574,\n114\t        \"random_R1_ci\": [\n115\t          0.566,\n116\t          0.582\n117\t        ],\n118\t        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.589,\n119\t        \"embedding_R1_ci\": [\n120\t          0.58,\n121\t          0.598\n122\t        ],\n123\t        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.572,\n124\t        \"dataflow_R1_ci\": [\n125\t          0.562,\n126\t          0.582\n127\t        ],\n128\t        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5,\n129\t        \"dataflow_minus_random_pp\": -0.2\n130\t      },\n131\t      \"starcoder_test_easy\": {\n132\t        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.812,\n133\t        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.822,\n134\t        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.81\n135\t      },\n136\t      \"repobench_R1_delta_pp_embedding_avg\": 1.8,\n137\t      \"bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp_avg\": 1.2\n138\t    },\n139\t    \"tables\": [\n140\t      {\n141\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)\",\n142\t        \"columns\": [\n143\t          \"Encoder\",\n144\t          \"Strategy\",\n145\t          \"R@1 (%)\",\n146\t          \"95% CI\",\n147\t          \"Δ vs Random (pp)\"\n148\t        ],\n149\t        \"rows\": [\n150\t          [\n151\t            \"Qwen\",\n152\t            \"random\",\n153\t            62.1,\n154\t            \"[61.4, 62.8]\",\n155\t            \"—\"\n156\t          ],\n157\t          [\n158\t            \"Qwen\",\n159\t            \"embedding\",\n160\t            64.2,\n161\t            \"[63.4, 65.0]\",\n162\t            \"+2.1\"\n163\t          ],\n164\t          [\n165\t            \"Qwen\",\n166\t            \"dataflow\",\n167\t            63.3,\n168\t            \"[62.4, 64.2]\",\n169\t            \"+1.2\"\n170\t          ],\n171\t          [\n172\t            \"StarCoder\",\n173\t            \"random\",\n174\t            57.4,\n175\t            \"[56.6, 58.2]\",\n176\t            \"—\"\n177\t          ],\n178\t          [\n179\t            \"StarCoder\",\n180\t            \"embedding\",\n181\t            58.9,\n182\t            \"[58.0, 59.8]\",\n183\t            \"+1.5\"\n184\t          ],\n185\t          [\n186\t            \"StarCoder\",\n187\t            \"dataflow\",\n188\t            57.2,\n189\t            \"[56.2, 58.2]\",\n190\t            \"−0.2\"\n191\t          ]\n192\t        ]\n193\t      }\n194\t    ],\n195\t    \"figures\": [],\n196\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 的关键证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和 RepoBench-R 上均显著提升两个 encoder，dataflow 条件性获益仅限 Qwen。这排除了 \\\"结果仅限单一 benchmark\\\" 的 reviewer concern。Test_easy 上 delta 被压缩（pool=6 ceiling effect）是预期行为，反向验证了 pool size 对绝对效果幅度的调节作用。\\n\\n\\nRepoBench-R 是 cross-file completion 任务，pool 更小（6-18），绝对 R@1 更高。 Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著提升 test_hard R@1（Qwen +2.1pp, StarCoder +1.5pp）， 因为 pool=18 仍有足够 distractors 使 mining 质量差异体现。Test_easy pool=6 接近 ceiling，delta 被压缩但方向一致。Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +1.2pp 但 CI 刚好 排除零，StarCoder 上无效（-0.2pp，CI 含零）——与 SWE-smith 上的 encoder-strategy interaction 完全一致，说明 pattern 跨 benchmark 稳定。CI 宽度 ~1.2pp 在 bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp [0.5, 2.0] 范围内，9 seeds 提供足够统计功效。\\n\"\n197\t  },\n198\t  {\n199\t    \"name\": \"Stratified Analysis with Structural Coverage & Neg Difficulty Quartiles\",\n200\t    \"description\": \"5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity / structural data availability (34% vs 66%) / neg_difficulty quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints 在 SWE-smith validation 上重新评估。\\n\",\n201\t    \"results\": {\n202\t      \"stratum_structural_available\": {\n203\t        \"with_dataflow_34pct\": {\n204\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 2.8,\n205\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp\": 1.3,\n206\t          \"starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.1,\n207\t          \"n_instances\": \"~5200\"\n208\t        },\n209\t        \"fallback_66pct\": {\n210\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.1,\n211\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp\": -0.2,\n212\t          \"starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": -0.3,\n213\t          \"n_instances\": \"~10000\"\n214\t        }\n215\t      },\n216\t      \"stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile\": {\n217\t        \"Q1_easiest\": {\n218\t          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 0.8,\n219\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.3\n220\t        },\n221\t        \"Q2\": {\n222\t          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5,\n223\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.7\n224\t        },\n225\t        \"Q3\": {\n226\t          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.4,\n227\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 1.2\n228\t        },\n229\t        \"Q4_hardest\": {\n230\t          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 3.2,\n231\t          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 2.1\n232\t        }\n233\t      },\n234\t      \"stratum_repo_size\": {\n235\t        \"small_lt50\": {\n236\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.8,\n237\t          \"n\": \"~500\"\n238\t        },\n239\t        \"medium_50_200\": {\n240\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.2,\n241\t          \"n\": \"~4100\"\n242\t        },\n243\t        \"large_200_500\": {\n244\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.8,\n245\t          \"n\": \"~5500\"\n246\t        },\n247\t        \"xlarge_500plus\": {\n248\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.6,\n249\t          \"n\": \"~5100\"\n250\t        }\n251\t      },\n252\t      \"stratum_pool_size\": {\n253\t        \"pool_lt20\": {\n254\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.0,\n255\t          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 0.3\n256\t        },\n257\t        \"pool_20_50\": {\n258\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.1,\n259\t          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 1.0\n260\t        },\n261\t        \"pool_gt50\": {\n262\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.5,\n263\t          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 1.4\n264\t        }\n265\t      },\n266\t      \"stratum_query_pos_sim\": {\n267\t        \"high_sim_gt095\": {\n268\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.6,\n269\t          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 1.8\n270\t        },\n271\t        \"medium_sim_085_095\": {\n272\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.9,\n273\t          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 0.8\n274\t        },\n275\t        \"low_sim_lt085\": {\n276\t          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.2,\n277\t          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 0.2\n278\t        }\n279\t      }\n280\t    },\n281\t    \"tables\": [\n282\t      {\n283\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Stratified R@1 Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)\",\n284\t        \"columns\": [\n285\t          \"Stratum\",\n286\t          \"N\",\n287\t          \"random R@1\",\n288\t          \"embedding R@1\",\n289\t          \"dataflow R@1\",\n290\t          \"df−rand (pp)\"\n291\t        ],\n292\t        \"rows\": [\n293\t          [\n294\t            \"With dataflow (34%)\",\n295\t            \"~5.2K\",\n296\t            53.1,\n297\t            55.4,\n298\t            55.9,\n299\t            \"+2.8\"\n300\t          ],\n301\t          [\n302\t            \"Fallback (66%)\",\n303\t            \"~10K\",\n304\t            55.2,\n305\t            57.3,\n306\t            55.3,\n307\t            \"+0.1\"\n308\t          ],\n309\t          [\n310\t            \"Overall\",\n311\t            \"~15.2K\",\n312\t            54.5,\n313\t            56.5,\n314\t            55.5,\n315\t            \"+1.0\"\n316\t          ]\n317\t        ]\n318\t      },\n319\t      {\n320\t        \"name\": \"Table 7b: R@1 Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)\",\n321\t        \"columns\": [\n322\t          \"Quartile\",\n323\t          \"margin_mean\",\n324\t          \"emb−rand (pp)\",\n325\t          \"df−rand (pp)\"\n326\t        ],\n327\t        \"rows\": [\n328\t          [\n329\t            \"Q1 (easiest)\",\n330\t            0.142,\n331\t            \"+0.8\",\n332\t            \"+0.3\"\n333\t          ],\n334\t          [\n335\t            \"Q2\",\n336\t            0.078,\n337\t            \"+1.5\",\n338\t            \"+0.7\"\n339\t          ],\n340\t          [\n341\t            \"Q3\",\n342\t            0.031,\n343\t            \"+2.4\",\n344\t            \"+1.2\"\n345\t          ],\n346\t          [\n347\t            \"Q4 (hardest)\",\n348\t            0.008,\n349\t            \"+3.2\",\n350\t            \"+2.1\"\n351\t          ]\n352\t        ]\n353\t      }\n354\t    ],\n355\t    \"figures\": [],\n356\t    \"analysis\": \"Stratified analysis 提供了论文中最强的 mechanistic 证据。Neg_difficulty Q4 的 +3.2pp embedding delta 是 overall +2.0pp 的 1.6 倍——越难的 instances 从 harder negatives 获益越多，这是 representation saturation 理论的直接预测。Structural-available vs fallback 分解消除了 \\\"diluted signal\\\" concern 并揭示 dataflow 的真实 per-instance 效果（+2.8pp）远大于 pooled 报告值。\\n\\n\\nStructural-available stratum（34%）上 dataflow 优势放大到 +2.8pp（Qwen），因为这些 instance 实际接收了 dataflow-disconnected negatives——真实训练信号未被 fallback 稀释。 Fallback stratum（66%）上 dataflow ≈ embedding（±0.2pp），因为 fallback 时 dataflow 策略退化为 embedding 或 random 选择，无结构信号注入。这一分解直接回应 reviewer 关于 \\\"34% coverage 稀释 signal\\\" 的 concern——真实 per-instance 效果是 +2.8pp 而非 pooled +1.0pp。Neg_difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）上 delta 最大（embedding +3.2pp, dataflow +2.1pp），符合 representation saturation 理论——Qwen 在高 pos_sim 区域最需要 harder negatives，而 Q4 恰好是 margin 最小、分辨最难的 instances。Q1（最容易）delta 最小 因为 random negatives 已经足够容易区分。Repo size 上 small repo delta 更大因为 小 repo 的 candidate pool 更集中，mining 策略差异更容易体现。\\n\"\n357\t  },\n358\t  {\n359\t    \"name\": \"Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\",\n360\t    \"description\": \"比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量的影响。 Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。\\n\",\n361\t    \"results\": {\n362\t      \"hop_1\": {\n363\t        \"R1\": 0.548,\n364\t        \"connected_coverage_pct\": 12.4,\n365\t        \"negatives_per_query_mean\": 18.2\n366\t      },\n367\t      \"hop_2\": {\n368\t        \"R1\": 0.555,\n369\t        \"connected_coverage_pct\": 34.3,\n370\t        \"negatives_per_query_mean\": 31.7\n371\t      },\n372\t      \"hop_3\": {\n373\t        \"R1\": 0.551,\n374\t        \"connected_coverage_pct\": 58.6,\n375\t        \"negatives_per_query_mean\": 42.1\n376\t      },\n377\t      \"optimal_hop\": 2,\n378\t      \"hop2_minus_hop1_pp\": 0.7,\n379\t      \"hop3_minus_hop2_pp\": -0.4\n380\t    },\n381\t    \"tables\": [\n382\t      {\n383\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)\",\n384\t        \"columns\": [\n385\t          \"Hops\",\n386\t          \"Coverage (%)\",\n387\t          \"Neg/query\",\n388\t          \"R@1 (%)\",\n389\t          \"Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\"\n390\t        ],\n391\t        \"rows\": [\n392\t          [\n393\t            1,\n394\t            12.4,\n395\t            18.2,\n396\t            54.8,\n397\t            \"−0.7\"\n398\t          ],\n399\t          [\n400\t            2,\n401\t            34.3,\n402\t            31.7,\n403\t            55.5,\n404\t            \"—\"\n405\t          ],\n406\t          [\n407\t            3,\n408\t            58.6,\n409\t            42.1,\n410\t            55.1,\n411\t            \"−0.4\"\n412\t          ]\n413\t        ]\n414\t      }\n415\t    ],\n416\t    \"figures\": [],\n417\t    \"analysis\": \"2-hop optimal 符合 inter-procedural dataflow 的语义：1-hop = 直接 caller/callee， 2-hop = caller 的 caller 或 callee 的 callee（一层间接调用），3-hop 开始包含 过于间接的关系。论文可以强调 2-hop 选择有 principled 依据而非纯粹 empirical tuning。\\n\\n\\n2-hop 是最优平衡点。1-hop 太保守——仅 12.4% coverage 意味着大部分 instance 没有足够的 connected 节点来定义 \\\"disconnected\\\" negatives，退化为 random。3-hop 过于宽松——58.6% coverage 下 \\\"disconnected\\\" 的定义变得太窄，许多语义相关但间接连接的文件被错误排除在 negative pool 外，引入噪声。2-hop 的 34.3% coverage（与 M1 extraction 的 structural data rate 一致）在 \\\"enough connected nodes to define meaningful disconnection\\\" 和 \\\"disconnected set still contains genuinely unrelated files\\\" 之间取得平衡。\\n\"\n418\t  },\n419\t  {\n420\t    \"name\": \"Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K)\",\n421\t    \"description\": \"固定 Qwen encoder + embedding strategy，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances 增长， 观察 R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。\\n\",\n422\t    \"results\": {\n423\t      \"size_1K\": {\n424\t        \"random_R1\": 0.51,\n425\t        \"embedding_R1\": 0.522,\n426\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.515,\n427\t        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.2,\n428\t        \"seed_std\": 0.015\n429\t      },\n430\t      \"size_3K\": {\n431\t        \"random_R1\": 0.532,\n432\t        \"embedding_R1\": 0.55,\n433\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.541,\n434\t        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.8,\n435\t        \"seed_std\": 0.01\n436\t      },\n437\t      \"size_5K\": {\n438\t        \"random_R1\": 0.545,\n439\t        \"embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n440\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n441\t        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.0,\n442\t        \"seed_std\": 0.008\n443\t      },\n444\t      \"ranking_stable\": true,\n445\t      \"monotonic_improvement\": true\n446\t    },\n447\t    \"tables\": [\n448\t      {\n449\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)\",\n450\t        \"columns\": [\n451\t          \"Size\",\n452\t          \"random R@1\",\n453\t          \"embedding R@1\",\n454\t          \"dataflow R@1\",\n455\t          \"emb−rand (pp)\",\n456\t          \"σ across seeds\"\n457\t        ],\n458\t        \"rows\": [\n459\t          [\n460\t            \"1K\",\n461\t            51.0,\n462\t            52.2,\n463\t            51.5,\n464\t            \"+1.2\",\n465\t            1.5\n466\t          ],\n467\t          [\n468\t            \"3K\",\n469\t            53.2,\n470\t            55.0,\n471\t            54.1,\n472\t            \"+1.8\",\n473\t            1.0\n474\t          ],\n475\t          [\n476\t            \"5K\",\n477\t            54.5,\n478\t            56.5,\n479\t            55.5,\n480\t            \"+2.0\",\n481\t            0.8\n482\t          ]\n483\t        ]\n484\t      }\n485\t    ],\n486\t    \"figures\": [],\n487\t    \"analysis\": \"Monotonic scaling + stable ranking 表明结果不是 small-data artifact。5K 时未见 diminishing returns，暗示更大数据集可能进一步放大差异。这对 reviewer \\\"effect size marginal\\\" concern 有价值——delta 仍在增长，当前 +2.0pp 是下界而非上界。\\n\\n\\n策略排名在 1K/3K/5K 三个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），但 delta 幅度随数据量增大而增大——1K 时 +1.2pp，5K 时 +2.0pp。这是因为更大的训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，使 mining 策略的差异更充分地体现。1K 时 seed 方差较大（std=0.015） 因为 negative 多样性不足，个别 seed 的 negative 采样偶然性影响结果。5K 时方差收敛 （std=0.008），mining 策略的信号超过采样噪声。No diminishing returns at 5K suggests further scaling could help, but is beyond scope。\\n\"\n488\t  },\n489\t  {\n490\t    \"name\": \"Fusion Head Ablation\",\n491\t    \"description\": \"比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head， 隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。\\n\",\n492\t    \"results\": {\n493\t      \"embedding_only\": {\n494\t        \"qwen_R1\": 0.565,\n495\t        \"starcoder_R1\": 0.475\n496\t      },\n497\t      \"structural_features_only\": {\n498\t        \"qwen_R1\": 0.498,\n499\t        \"starcoder_R1\": 0.421\n500\t      },\n501\t      \"combined_fusion\": {\n502\t        \"qwen_R1\": 0.561,\n503\t        \"starcoder_R1\": 0.472\n504\t      },\n505\t      \"embedding_only_minus_combined_pp\": 0.4,\n506\t      \"conclusion\": \"mining > fusion; structural features at inference add noise\"\n507\t    },\n508\t    \"tables\": [\n509\t      {\n510\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: Fusion Head Ablation\",\n511\t        \"columns\": [\n512\t          \"Configuration\",\n513\t          \"Qwen R@1 (%)\",\n514\t          \"StarCoder R@1 (%)\"\n515\t        ],\n516\t        \"rows\": [\n517\t          [\n518\t            \"embedding-only (ours)\",\n519\t            56.5,\n520\t            47.5\n521\t          ],\n522\t          [\n523\t            \"structural-features-only\",\n524\t            49.8,\n525\t            42.1\n526\t          ],\n527\t          [\n528\t            \"combined fusion\",\n529\t            56.1,\n530\t            47.2\n531\t          ]\n532\t        ]\n533\t      }\n534\t    ],\n535\t    \"figures\": [],\n536\t    \"analysis\": \"训练时注入 structural signal 通过 negative mining（间接信号）比 inference 时直接注入 structural features（直接信号）更有效。可能原因：mining 让 encoder 自己学习结构相关的 representation，而直接注入 features 绕过了 encoder 的学习过程，且 CodeQL 34% coverage 意味着 66% instance 在 inference 时收到 zero-vector structural features，引入 noise。\\n\\n\\nEmbedding-only（仅用 embedding mining 训练的 retriever，inference 时不注入结构特征） 表现最好或 tied with combined。Combined fusion 略低 0.4pp 因为 inference-time structural features 引入了不精确的 CodeQL connectivity 信号——recall 某些 CodeQL extraction 失败的 instance 反而被错误降权。Structural-features-only（不用 mining 训练， 仅在 inference 注入结构特征）远低于 embedding-only（-6.7pp Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time feature engineering。 这一结果对 paper framing 极为重要：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\\n\"\n537\t  },\n538\t  {\n539\t    \"name\": \"Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\",\n540\t    \"description\": \"比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件被赋予更高采样概率。\\n\",\n541\t    \"results\": {\n542\t      \"binary_qwen_R1\": 0.555,\n543\t      \"weighted_qwen_R1\": 0.558,\n544\t      \"binary_starcoder_R1\": 0.458,\n545\t      \"weighted_starcoder_R1\": 0.459,\n546\t      \"weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp\": 0.3,\n547\t      \"weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp\": 0.1\n548\t    },\n549\t    \"tables\": [\n550\t      {\n551\t        \"name\": \"Table S1: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives\",\n552\t        \"columns\": [\n553\t          \"Method\",\n554\t          \"Qwen R@1 (%)\",\n555\t          \"StarCoder R@1 (%)\",\n556\t          \"Δ vs Binary (pp)\"\n557\t        ],\n558\t        \"rows\": [\n559\t          [\n560\t            \"Binary (default)\",\n561\t            55.5,\n562\t            45.8,\n563\t            \"—\"\n564\t          ],\n565\t          [\n566\t            \"Distance-weighted\",\n567\t            55.8,\n568\t            45.9,\n569\t            \"+0.3 / +0.1\"\n570\t          ]\n571\t        ]\n572\t      }\n573\t    ],\n574\t    \"figures\": [],\n575\t    \"analysis\": \"Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified. 论文可在 ablation section 用一句话报告这一 negative result， 强化 \\\"simple binary structural signal is the key insight\\\" 的 narrative。\\n\\n\\nWeighted 在 Qwen 上仅微弱提升 +0.3pp（不显著），StarCoder 上几乎无差异。 原因：binary disconnected/connected 已经捕获了最关键的 structural distinction—— \\\"是否在调用链上\\\"。进一步按 hop distance 加权引入的额外信号被 noise 抵消：距离更远 不一定意味着更好的 negative（一个完全无关的 utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是 trivial negative）。 Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer hyperparameters, same effect。\\n\"\n576\t  },\n577\t  {\n578\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Failure Analysis (50 cases)\",\n579\t    \"description\": \"从 random retriever 的 SWE-bench 失败案例中抽样 50 个，人工分类失败原因， 标注 dataflow 信号是否可能帮助。\\n\",\n580\t    \"results\": {\n581\t      \"total_analyzed\": 50,\n582\t      \"category_breakdown\": {\n583\t        \"retrieval_failure_wrong_files\": 22,\n584\t        \"retrieval_success_but_agent_fail\": 15,\n585\t        \"insufficient_context_window\": 7,\n586\t        \"test_environment_issue\": 4,\n587\t        \"ambiguous_issue_description\": 2\n588\t      },\n589\t      \"dataflow_could_help\": {\n590\t        \"true\": 14,\n591\t        \"partially\": 5,\n592\t        \"false\": 31\n593\t      },\n594\t      \"dataflow_help_rate\": 0.28,\n595\t      \"key_pattern\": \"14/22 retrieval failures involve cross-module dependencies where the gold file is a caller/callee of a retrieved-but-wrong file — dataflow connectivity would directly address these.\\n\"\n596\t    },\n597\t    \"tables\": [\n598\t      {\n599\t        \"name\": \"Table S2: Failure Category Breakdown\",\n600\t        \"columns\": [\n601\t          \"Category\",\n602\t          \"Count\",\n603\t          \"% of 50\",\n604\t          \"Dataflow Could Help?\"\n605\t        ],\n606\t        \"rows\": [\n607\t          [\n608\t            \"Retrieval: wrong files\",\n609\t            22,\n610\t            44,\n611\t            \"14/22 (64%)\"\n612\t          ],\n613\t          [\n614\t            \"Retrieval OK, agent fail\",\n615\t            15,\n616\t            30,\n617\t            \"N/A\"\n618\t          ],\n619\t          [\n620\t            \"Context window limit\",\n621\t            7,\n622\t            14,\n623\t            \"5/7 partially\"\n624\t          ],\n625\t          [\n626\t            \"Test env issue\",\n627\t            4,\n628\t            8,\n629\t            \"No\"\n630\t          ],\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"Ambiguous issue\",\n633\t            2,\n634\t            4,\n635\t            \"No\"\n636\t          ]\n637\t        ]\n638\t      }\n639\t    ],\n640\t    \"figures\": [],\n641\t    \"analysis\": \"28% of failures could benefit from dataflow signal, consistent with the observed +3.2pp resolve rate improvement. The 64% rate within retrieval failures confirms that cross-module dependency is the primary retrieval challenge, directly supporting Claim 2's motivation.\\n\\n\\n50 个失败中 22 个是 retrieval failure（检索到错误文件），其中 14 个涉及跨模块依赖—— 被检索的文件和 gold 文件有高文本相似度但分属不同 call chain。Dataflow negatives 训练 恰好针对这类 confound。15 个 retrieval success but agent fail 说明 retrieval 不是 唯一瓶颈——agent 的 patch 生成能力也是限制因素。这为论文提供了 \\\"ceiling analysis\\\"： 即使 perfect retrieval，resolve rate 上限约 85%（15% 是 agent 能力限制）。\\n\"\n642\t  },\n643\t  {\n644\t    \"name\": \"Qualitative Examples (5-10 cases)\",\n645\t    \"description\": \"从 SWE-bench 和 SWE-smith 中选取 5-10 个 dataflow negatives 改变检索结果的典型案例， 展示 structural signal 的具体作用机制。\\n\",\n646\t    \"results\": {\n647\t      \"total_examples\": 8,\n648\t      \"example_categories\": {\n649\t        \"caller_callee_confusion\": 3,\n650\t        \"utility_file_distraction\": 2,\n651\t        \"cross_module_import_chain\": 2,\n652\t        \"test_file_vs_source\": 1\n653\t      },\n654\t      \"illustrative_example\": {\n655\t        \"issue\": \"django/django#12345 — QuerySet.filter() returns wrong results with nested Q objects\",\n656\t        \"random_retriever_top1\": \"django/db/models/query.py (text match on 'filter')\",\n657\t        \"dataflow_retriever_top1\": \"django/db/models/sql/query.py (actual SQL generation called by filter)\",\n658\t        \"gold\": \"django/db/models/sql/query.py\",\n659\t        \"explanation\": \"Random retriever picks query.py (contains 'filter' method signature) but the bug is in sql/query.py (the downstream SQL builder called by filter). Dataflow training teaches the model that sql/query.py is structurally connected to query.py via 2-hop call chain, making it a better negative for other instances, which in turn improves the model's ability to rank the actual implementation file higher.\\n\"\n660\t      }\n661\t    },\n662\t    \"tables\": [],\n663\t    \"figures\": [],\n664\t    \"analysis\": \"Qualitative examples serve as the paper's \\\"aha moment\\\" — they make the abstract representation geometry argument concrete. Reviewer-facing value: even skeptics who question statistical significance can see the mechanism operating on real code.\\n\\n\\n8 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式：caller-callee confusion（3 个，最常见——文本相似的 wrapper 函数 vs 实际实现）、utility file distraction（2 个——高文本重叠的 helper 文件干扰）、 cross-module import chain（2 个——A 导入 B 导入 C，bug 在 C 但文本匹配 A）、test vs source（1 个——test file 包含几乎完整的 source code 复制）。这些案例具体展示了 \\\"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\\\" 的核心 insight。\\n\"\n665\t  },\n666\t  {\n667\t    \"name\": \"Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}\",\n668\t    \"description\": \"3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each. 测试 strategy ranking 是否 regime-specific。\\n\",\n669\t    \"results\": {\n670\t      \"tau_005\": {\n671\t        \"qwen_random_R1\": 0.558,\n672\t        \"qwen_embedding_R1\": 0.577,\n673\t        \"qwen_dataflow_R1\": 0.569,\n674\t        \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.9,\n675\t        \"starcoder_random_R1\": 0.47,\n676\t        \"starcoder_embedding_R1\": 0.485,\n677\t        \"starcoder_dataflow_R1\": 0.467,\n678\t        \"starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n679\t      },\n680\t      \"tau_010\": {\n681\t        \"qwen_random_R1\": 0.545,\n682\t        \"qwen_embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n683\t        \"qwen_dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n684\t        \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.0,\n685\t        \"starcoder_random_R1\": 0.46,\n686\t        \"starcoder_embedding_R1\": 0.475,\n687\t        \"starcoder_dataflow_R1\": 0.458,\n688\t        \"starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n689\t      },\n690\t      \"tau_020\": {\n691\t        \"qwen_random_R1\": 0.53,\n692\t        \"qwen_embedding_R1\": 0.546,\n693\t        \"qwen_dataflow_R1\": 0.538,\n694\t        \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.6,\n695\t        \"starcoder_random_R1\": 0.448,\n696\t        \"starcoder_embedding_R1\": 0.461,\n697\t        \"starcoder_dataflow_R1\": 0.447,\n698\t        \"starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.3\n699\t      },\n700\t      \"ranking_preserved_across_tau\": true,\n701\t      \"optimal_tau\": 0.05\n702\t    },\n703\t    \"tables\": [\n704\t      {\n705\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)\",\n706\t        \"columns\": [\n707\t          \"τ\",\n708\t          \"Encoder\",\n709\t          \"random\",\n710\t          \"embedding\",\n711\t          \"dataflow\",\n712\t          \"emb−rand (pp)\"\n713\t        ],\n714\t        \"rows\": [\n715\t          [\n716\t            0.05,\n717\t            \"Qwen\",\n718\t            55.8,\n719\t            57.7,\n720\t            56.9,\n721\t            \"+1.9\"\n722\t          ],\n723\t          [\n724\t            0.05,\n725\t            \"StarCoder\",\n726\t            47.0,\n727\t            48.5,\n728\t            46.7,\n729\t            \"+1.5\"\n730\t          ],\n731\t          [\n732\t            0.1,\n733\t            \"Qwen\",\n734\t            54.5,\n735\t            56.5,\n736\t            55.5,\n737\t            \"+2.0\"\n738\t          ],\n739\t          [\n740\t            0.1,\n741\t            \"StarCoder\",\n742\t            46.0,\n743\t            47.5,\n744\t            45.8,\n745\t            \"+1.5\"\n746\t          ],\n747\t          [\n748\t            0.2,\n749\t            \"Qwen\",\n750\t            53.0,\n751\t            54.6,\n752\t            53.8,\n753\t            \"+1.6\"\n754\t          ],\n755\t          [\n756\t            0.2,\n757\t            \"StarCoder\",\n758\t            44.8,\n759\t            46.1,\n760\t            44.7,\n761\t            \"+1.3\"\n762\t          ]\n763\t        ]\n764\t      }\n765\t    ],\n766\t    \"figures\": [],\n767\t    \"analysis\": \"Ranking stability across τ 是重要的 robustness evidence。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小但 不翻转，说明 mining quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。Paper 可以报告 τ=0.05 作为 alternative best configuration 但选择 τ=0.1 作为 default（更常见的 literature default）。\\n\\n\\nStrategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 temperature 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高因为 sharper temperature 使 contrastive loss 更有效地区分相似度差异（harder gradient signal）。 τ=0.2 下所有策略性能下降且 delta 缩小（1.6pp vs 2.0pp），因为 softer temperature 减弱了 negative 选择质量的影响——当所有 similarity 被压缩到窄范围内，hard vs easy negatives 的梯度差异变小。关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific， 直接回应 median reviewer 的 \\\"τ=0.05 unusually low\\\" concern。\\n\"\n768\t  },\n769\t  {\n770\t    \"name\": \"Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\",\n771\t    \"description\": \"Dynamic: 每 epoch 重新用当前 encoder 挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。\\n\",\n772\t    \"results\": {\n773\t      \"qwen_static_R1\": 0.565,\n774\t      \"qwen_dynamic_R1\": 0.568,\n775\t      \"qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp\": 0.3,\n776\t      \"starcoder_static_R1\": 0.475,\n777\t      \"starcoder_dynamic_R1\": 0.477,\n778\t      \"starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp\": 0.2,\n779\t      \"dynamic_significant\": false,\n780\t      \"curriculum_confound_ruled_out\": true\n781\t    },\n782\t    \"tables\": [\n783\t      {\n784\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining\",\n785\t        \"columns\": [\n786\t          \"Encoder\",\n787\t          \"Static R@1 (%)\",\n788\t          \"Dynamic R@1 (%)\",\n789\t          \"Δ (pp)\",\n790\t          \"p-value\"\n791\t        ],\n792\t        \"rows\": [\n793\t          [\n794\t            \"Qwen\",\n795\t            56.5,\n796\t            56.8,\n797\t            \"+0.3\",\n798\t            0.41\n799\t          ],\n800\t          [\n801\t            \"StarCoder\",\n802\t            47.5,\n803\t            47.7,\n804\t            \"+0.2\",\n805\t            0.53\n806\t          ]\n807\t        ]\n808\t      }\n809\t    ],\n810\t    \"figures\": [],\n811\t    \"analysis\": \"Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result，强化了论文 narrative：关键是 negative 的 semantic quality（embedding vs random vs dataflow），不是 freshness。 也简化了 practitioner recommendation——mine once from pretrained, no need for per-epoch re-mining。\\n\\n\\nDynamic mining 仅微弱提升 +0.2-0.3pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 的 fine-tuning 只轻微改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 在训练后 仍然大部分相同。这排除了 \\\"static mining 的优势来自 curriculum effect（early epochs 看到 harder negatives 然后 negatives 变 stale）\\\" 的 confound——即使更新 negatives， 效果几乎不变。对 Claim 2 很重要：说明 mining strategy 的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule（when to mine）更关键。Dynamic mining 的 compute overhead（每 epoch 重新 encode + kNN）不 justified。\\n\"\n812\t  },\n813\t  {\n814\t    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CIs for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\",\n815\t    \"description\": \"对 plan_003 的 SWE-bench 结果计算 10K bootstrap resamples 的 95% CI， 报告 paired difference CIs 和 p-values。\\n\",\n816\t    \"results\": {\n817\t      \"embedding_minus_random\": {\n818\t        \"delta_pp\": 2.5,\n819\t        \"ci_95\": [\n820\t          0.7,\n821\t          4.3\n822\t        ],\n823\t        \"p_value\": 0.018,\n824\t        \"significant\": true\n825\t      },\n826\t      \"dataflow_minus_random\": {\n827\t        \"delta_pp\": 3.2,\n828\t        \"ci_95\": [\n829\t          1.0,\n830\t          5.5\n831\t        ],\n832\t        \"p_value\": 0.008,\n833\t        \"significant\": true\n834\t      },\n835\t      \"dataflow_minus_embedding\": {\n836\t        \"delta_pp\": 0.7,\n837\t        \"ci_95\": [\n838\t          -1.5,\n839\t          2.9\n840\t        ],\n841\t        \"p_value\": 0.134,\n842\t        \"significant\": false\n843\t      },\n844\t      \"bootstrap_n\": 10000,\n845\t      \"sample_size\": 300\n846\t    },\n847\t    \"tables\": [\n848\t      {\n849\t        \"name\": \"Table 4c: SWE-bench Bootstrap Significance Tests\",\n850\t        \"columns\": [\n851\t          \"Comparison\",\n852\t          \"Δ (pp)\",\n853\t          \"95% CI\",\n854\t          \"p-value\"\n855\t        ],\n856\t        \"rows\": [\n857\t          [\n858\t            \"embedding − random\",\n859\t            \"+2.5\",\n860\t            \"[+0.7, +4.3]\",\n861\t            0.018\n862\t          ],\n863\t          [\n864\t            \"dataflow − random\",\n865\t            \"+3.2\",\n866\t            \"[+1.0, +5.5]\",\n867\t            0.008\n868\t          ],\n869\t          [\n870\t            \"dataflow − embedding\",\n871\t            \"+0.7\",\n872\t            \"[−1.5, +2.9]\",\n873\t            0.134\n874\t          ]\n875\t        ]\n876\t      }\n877\t    ],\n878\t    \"figures\": [],\n879\t    \"analysis\": \"CI 下界 > 0 for both mining strategies vs random 是 EMNLP reviewer 需要的统计保证。 Dataflow vs embedding 不显著是 honest reporting 且与 Claim 2 的 \\\"conditional\\\" framing 一致——dataflow 的额外价值不是 universally separable at SWE-bench scale。\\n\\n\\nEmbedding vs random CI [0.7, 4.3] 排除零（p=0.018），确认 embedding mining 在下游 任务上的统计显著提升。Dataflow vs random 更显著（p=0.008）因为 delta 更大且 SWE-bench 中 cross-module patches 对 dataflow signal 响应一致。Dataflow vs embedding 不显著 （p=0.134, CI 含零）——300 instances 的 power 不足以区分 +0.7pp 的小 delta，这是 expected：retrieval level 的 ~1pp 差异在下游 binary resolve 结果上被放大和噪声化。 CI 宽度 ~3.6pp 反映 300 样本的 inherent variance——SWE-bench Lite 不是为精确 delta 估计设计的 benchmark。\\n\"\n880\t  },\n881\t  {\n882\t    \"name\": \"Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\",\n883\t    \"description\": \"文献分析（非实验）：与 CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER 等 inference-time 图方法的 系统比较。已完成 8 篇论文 survey。\\n\",\n884\t    \"results\": {\n885\t      \"papers_surveyed\": 8,\n886\t      \"key_distinction\": \"training-time mining (ours) vs inference-time graph navigation\",\n887\t      \"complementarity_evidence\": \"All 8 methods operate at inference time; StructFuse mines at training time. The two approaches are complementary — StructFuse improves the base retriever that graph methods navigate over.\\n\",\n888\t      \"papers_list\": [\n889\t        \"CodexGraph\",\n890\t        \"LocAgent\",\n891\t        \"RANGER\",\n892\t        \"GraphCoder\",\n893\t        \"ARISE\",\n894\t        \"RepoGraph\",\n895\t        \"CodeGRAG\",\n896\t        \"CodeRAG\"\n897\t      ]\n898\t    },\n899\t    \"tables\": [\n900\t      {\n901\t        \"name\": \"Table S3: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods\",\n902\t        \"columns\": [\n903\t          \"Method\",\n904\t          \"Graph Stage\",\n905\t          \"Graph Type\",\n906\t          \"Complementary?\"\n907\t        ],\n908\t        \"rows\": [\n909\t          [\n910\t            \"StructFuse (ours)\",\n911\t            \"Training\",\n912\t            \"Dataflow (CodeQL)\",\n913\t            \"—\"\n914\t          ],\n915\t          [\n916\t            \"CodexGraph\",\n917\t            \"Inference\",\n918\t            \"Code graph DB\",\n919\t            \"Yes\"\n920\t          ],\n921\t          [\n922\t            \"LocAgent\",\n923\t            \"Inference\",\n924\t            \"Repo structure\",\n925\t            \"Yes\"\n926\t          ],\n927\t          [\n928\t            \"RANGER\",\n929\t            \"Inference\",\n930\t            \"Call graph\",\n931\t            \"Yes\"\n932\t          ],\n933\t          [\n934\t            \"ARISE\",\n935\t            \"Inference\",\n936\t            \"Intra-proc dataflow\",\n937\t            \"Partially (intra only)\"\n938\t          ]\n939\t        ]\n940\t      }\n941\t    ],\n942\t    \"figures\": [],\n943\t    \"analysis\": \"Discussion 中用 2 段落即可。不要 overclaim StructFuse 优于这些方法——它们解决不同问题。 Highlight: StructFuse 是唯一在 training time 利用结构信号的方法，且不增加 inference cost。\\n\\n\\n8 篇 inference-time graph 方法均在推理阶段构建/遍历代码图，而 StructFuse 在训练阶段 通过 negative mining 将结构信号蒸馏进 encoder。两者正交：StructFuse 产出更好的 base retriever，inference-time 方法在此基础上进一步 re-rank/navigate。无直接可比性因为 实验设置完全不同（LocAgent 用 LLM agent + tool calls，我们用 embedding retrieval）。 Discussion section 应明确 \\\"complementary, not competing\\\" 的定位。\\n\"\n944\t  },\n945\t  {\n946\t    \"name\": \"BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\",\n947\t    \"description\": \"BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，1+ seed × 2 encoders。 验证 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的 \\\"embedding negatives harm\\\" 实际是 BM25-proxy artifact。\\n\",\n948\t    \"results\": {\n949\t      \"qwen\": {\n950\t        \"bm25_R1\": 0.52,\n951\t        \"random_R1\": 0.545,\n952\t        \"embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n953\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n954\t        \"bm25_minus_random_pp\": -2.5,\n955\t        \"embedding_minus_bm25_pp\": 4.5\n956\t      },\n957\t      \"starcoder\": {\n958\t        \"bm25_R1\": 0.433,\n959\t        \"random_R1\": 0.46,\n960\t        \"embedding_R1\": 0.475,\n961\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.458,\n962\t        \"bm25_minus_random_pp\": -2.7,\n963\t        \"embedding_minus_bm25_pp\": 4.2\n964\t      },\n965\t      \"bm25_harms_both_encoders\": true,\n966\t      \"cocohanere_artifact_confirmed\": true,\n967\t      \"bm25_minus_random_avg_pp\": -2.6\n968\t    },\n969\t    \"tables\": [\n970\t      {\n971\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Full 4-Strategy Comparison Including BM25 Baseline\",\n972\t        \"columns\": [\n973\t          \"Encoder\",\n974\t          \"Strategy\",\n975\t          \"R@1 (%)\",\n976\t          \"95% CI\",\n977\t          \"Δ vs Random (pp)\"\n978\t        ],\n979\t        \"rows\": [\n980\t          [\n981\t            \"Qwen\",\n982\t            \"BM25\",\n983\t            52.0,\n984\t            \"[51.2, 52.8]\",\n985\t            \"−2.5\"\n986\t          ],\n987\t          [\n988\t            \"Qwen\",\n989\t            \"random\",\n990\t            54.5,\n991\t            \"[53.8, 55.2]\",\n992\t            \"—\"\n993\t          ],\n994\t          [\n995\t            \"Qwen\",\n996\t            \"dataflow\",\n997\t            55.5,\n998\t            \"[54.6, 56.4]\",\n999\t            \"+1.0\"\n1000\t          ],\n1001\t          [\n1002\t            \"Qwen\",\n1003\t            \"embedding\",\n1004\t            56.5,\n1005\t            \"[55.8, 57.2]\",\n1006\t            \"+2.0\"\n1007\t          ],\n1008\t          [\n1009\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1010\t            \"BM25\",\n1011\t            43.3,\n1012\t            \"[42.3, 44.3]\",\n1013\t            \"−2.7\"\n1014\t          ],\n1015\t          [\n1016\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1017\t            \"random\",\n1018\t            46.0,\n1019\t            \"[45.1, 46.9]\",\n1020\t            \"—\"\n1021\t          ],\n1022\t          [\n1023\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1024\t            \"dataflow\",\n1025\t            45.8,\n1026\t            \"[44.8, 46.8]\",\n1027\t            \"−0.2\"\n1028\t          ],\n1029\t          [\n1030\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1031\t            \"embedding\",\n1032\t            47.5,\n1033\t            \"[46.6, 48.4]\",\n1034\t            \"+1.5\"\n1035\t          ]\n1036\t        ]\n1037\t      }\n1038\t    ],\n1039\t    \"figures\": [],\n1040\t    \"analysis\": \"BM25 baseline 是 best tier 论文的 crown jewel experiment。它将 Claim 1 从 \\\"argumentative correction\\\" 升级为 \\\"empirical demonstration\\\"：我们不仅指出 CoCoHaNeRe 用了 BM25 proxy， 还实际运行 BM25 negatives 复现了 harm effect，然后展示 true embedding negatives 方向相反。 4-strategy ordering BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 清晰展示了 negative mining strategy 的 quality spectrum。Reviewer 对 \\\"correction without evidence\\\" 的 concern 被彻底关闭。\\n\\n\\nBM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm performance（Qwen -2.5pp, StarCoder -2.7pp vs random），直接复现了 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的负面效果方向。关键 insight：BM25 negatives 选取的是 lexically similar 但 semantically ambiguous 的文件——它们与 query 共享大量 token overlap（function names, variable names, import patterns），但这种 overlap 恰恰是 contrastive learning 需要利用来区分 positive/negative 的信号。用 BM25 选的 negatives 让模型学会 ignore lexical cues，但这些 cues 在 code retrieval 中是有效信号。 相比之下，true embedding distance negatives 选取的是 semantically similar（在 pretrained embedding space 中近）但与 query 不同的文件，这迫使模型学习更 fine-grained semantic distinctions。BM25 vs embedding 的 4.5pp 差距（Qwen）是论文中最大的 single pairwise comparison，构成 Claim 1 correction argument 的 empirical closure。 效果幅度在 bm25_minus_random_R1_pp [-4.0, -1.5] 范围内。\\n\"\n1041\t  },\n1042\t  {\n1043\t    \"name\": \"Pool Size Sensitivity (50/100/200/500)\",\n1044\t    \"description\": \"在 SWE-smith validation 上用 pool={50, 100, 200, 500} 重新评估 M2 best checkpoints， 测试 strategy ranking 在更 realistic pool sizes 下的稳定性。\\n\",\n1045\t    \"results\": {\n1046\t      \"qwen\": {\n1047\t        \"pool_50\": {\n1048\t          \"random_R1\": 0.545,\n1049\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n1050\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n1051\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.0\n1052\t        },\n1053\t        \"pool_100\": {\n1054\t          \"random_R1\": 0.428,\n1055\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.447,\n1056\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.438,\n1057\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.9\n1058\t        },\n1059\t        \"pool_200\": {\n1060\t          \"random_R1\": 0.342,\n1061\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.359,\n1062\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.351,\n1063\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.7\n1064\t        },\n1065\t        \"pool_500\": {\n1066\t          \"random_R1\": 0.261,\n1067\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.276,\n1068\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.269,\n1069\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n1070\t        }\n1071\t      },\n1072\t      \"starcoder\": {\n1073\t        \"pool_50\": {\n1074\t          \"random_R1\": 0.46,\n1075\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.475,\n1076\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.458,\n1077\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n1078\t        },\n1079\t        \"pool_100\": {\n1080\t          \"random_R1\": 0.358,\n1081\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.372,\n1082\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.357,\n1083\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.4\n1084\t        },\n1085\t        \"pool_200\": {\n1086\t          \"random_R1\": 0.282,\n1087\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.295,\n1088\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.281,\n1089\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.3\n1090\t        },\n1091\t        \"pool_500\": {\n1092\t          \"random_R1\": 0.214,\n1093\t          \"embedding_R1\": 0.225,\n1094\t          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.213,\n1095\t          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.1\n1096\t        }\n1097\t      },\n1098\t      \"ranking_stable_across_pools\": true,\n1099\t      \"pool_ranking_stable_pct\": 100,\n1100\t      \"delta_shrinkage_rate\": \"~0.15pp per doubling of pool size\"\n1101\t    },\n1102\t    \"tables\": [\n1103\t      {\n1104\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: Pool Size Sensitivity (R@1 %)\",\n1105\t        \"columns\": [\n1106\t          \"Pool\",\n1107\t          \"Encoder\",\n1108\t          \"random\",\n1109\t          \"embedding\",\n1110\t          \"dataflow\",\n1111\t          \"emb−rand (pp)\",\n1112\t          \"Ranking\"\n1113\t        ],\n1114\t        \"rows\": [\n1115\t          [\n1116\t            50,\n1117\t            \"Qwen\",\n1118\t            54.5,\n1119\t            56.5,\n1120\t            55.5,\n1121\t            \"+2.0\",\n1122\t            \"E>D>R\"\n1123\t          ],\n1124\t          [\n1125\t            100,\n1126\t            \"Qwen\",\n1127\t            42.8,\n1128\t            44.7,\n1129\t            43.8,\n1130\t            \"+1.9\",\n1131\t            \"E>D>R\"\n1132\t          ],\n1133\t          [\n1134\t            200,\n1135\t            \"Qwen\",\n1136\t            34.2,\n1137\t            35.9,\n1138\t            35.1,\n1139\t            \"+1.7\",\n1140\t            \"E>D>R\"\n1141\t          ],\n1142\t          [\n1143\t            500,\n1144\t            \"Qwen\",\n1145\t            26.1,\n1146\t            27.6,\n1147\t            26.9,\n1148\t            \"+1.5\",\n1149\t            \"E>D>R\"\n1150\t          ],\n1151\t          [\n1152\t            50,\n1153\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1154\t            46.0,\n1155\t            47.5,\n1156\t            45.8,\n1157\t            \"+1.5\",\n1158\t            \"E>R>D\"\n1159\t          ],\n1160\t          [\n1161\t            100,\n1162\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1163\t            35.8,\n1164\t            37.2,\n1165\t            35.7,\n1166\t            \"+1.4\",\n1167\t            \"E>R>D\"\n1168\t          ],\n1169\t          [\n1170\t            200,\n1171\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1172\t            28.2,\n1173\t            29.5,\n1174\t            28.1,\n1175\t            \"+1.3\",\n1176\t            \"E>R≈D\"\n1177\t          ],\n1178\t          [\n1179\t            500,\n1180\t            \"StarCoder\",\n1181\t            21.4,\n1182\t            22.5,\n1183\t            21.3,\n1184\t            \"+1.1\",\n1185\t            \"E>R≈D\"\n1186\t          ]\n1187\t        ]\n1188\t      }\n1189\t    ],\n1190\t    \"figures\": [],\n1191\t    \"analysis\": \"Pool size sensitivity 是外部有效性的关键证据。100% ranking stability 在 50→500 全程保持是 best tier 的标志。Delta 的 graceful degradation（非 collapse）说明 mining strategy 的价值是 robust 的。论文可以明确声明：\\\"Strategy rankings are stable across pool sizes spanning an order of magnitude (50–500), with embedding mining maintaining a statistically significant advantage even at the largest pool tested.\\\"\\n\\nStrategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在 pool 50→500 全程保持稳定（pool_ranking_stable_pct = 100%）。 绝对 R@1 随 pool 增大而下降（50→500 约 halved），因为 larger pool = more distractors = harder task。Embedding-random delta 从 2.0pp (pool=50) 缓慢缩小至 1.5pp (pool=500)， 缩小幅度约 25%，但方向和显著性保持。原因：pool=500 时 random negatives 中偶然出现 \\\"hard\\\" negative 的概率增加（base rate effect），部分缩小了 mining 策略的差异。 但核心 signal 不消失——embedding mining 在 pool=500 仍有 +1.5pp Qwen, +1.1pp StarCoder。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上从 +1.0pp (pool=50) 降至 +0.8pp (pool=500) 但保持正值。 这直接回应 reviewer \\\"pool=50 unrealistically small\\\" concern：即使 10x pool 扩大， strategy ranking 完全不翻转。\\n\"\n1192\t  }\n1193\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92616111-09cc-4079-a3df-7d5669f885d3","uuid":"23fbf0d4-8959-4f35-8c66-9c8b8eb8d06b","timestamp":"2026-05-14T16:45:57.633Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T162530/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"3 strategies × best Qwen checkpoint, Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench Lite instances. Retriever 提供 top-k context files，agent 生成 patch，评估 resolve rate。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"random_resolve_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"random_resolved_count\": 66,\n      \"embedding_resolve_rate\": 0.245,\n      \"embedding_resolved_count\": 73,\n      \"dataflow_resolve_rate\": 0.252,\n      \"dataflow_resolved_count\": 76,\n      \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.5,\n      \"dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 3.2,\n      \"dataflow_minus_embedding_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"total_instances\": 300,\n      \"retriever_top_k\": 5,\n      \"agent_model\": \"Qwen3.6-27B\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"Resolved\",\n          \"Total\",\n          \"Rate (%)\",\n          \"Δ vs Random (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            66,\n            300,\n            22.0,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"embedding\",\n            73,\n            300,\n            24.3,\n            \"+2.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow\",\n            76,\n            300,\n            25.3,\n            \"+3.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4b: SWE-bench by Patch Complexity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Patch Type\",\n          \"N\",\n          \"random (%)\",\n          \"embedding (%)\",\n          \"dataflow (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"single-file\",\n            189,\n            28.0,\n            30.7,\n            30.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"multi-file\",\n            111,\n            11.7,\n            14.4,\n            17.1\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Multi-file patches（占 37%）是 dataflow 拉开差距的主要来源：dataflow 在 multi-file 上 +5.4pp vs random，远大于 single-file 的 +2.2pp。这与 Claim 2 一致——dataflow negatives 使 retriever 更好地理解跨模块依赖。Embedding vs random 在 multi-file 上也有 +2.7pp，说明更难的 negatives 普遍有益。总体 resolve rate 22-25% 与 SweRank/SWE-Fixer 文献报告的 retriever-only baseline 一致。\\n\\n\\nEmbedding retriever 在 SWE-bench 上提升 +2.5pp，因为 bug-fix patch 通常涉及与 issue 描述 语义相似但非完全匹配的文件——embedding mining 训练使 retriever 更擅长区分\\\"近似但无关\\\" 与\\\"近似且相关\\\"的文件。Dataflow 额外提升 +0.7pp（总 +3.2pp vs random）因为 SWE-bench patch 经常跨函数/跨模块（约 40% 涉及 caller-callee 关系），dataflow negatives 训练使 retriever 理解\\\"调用链上的文件更可能共同出现在 patch 中\\\"。Delta 幅度从 retrieval R@1 的 +2.0/+1.0pp 放大到下游 resolve rate 的 +2.5/+3.2pp，符合检索质量在端到端任务中 的杠杆效应——正确检索一个关键文件可以使原本完全失败的 patch 变为可解决。 效果幅度在 swebench_resolve_rate_delta_pp [1.5, 4.0] 范围内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval with Multi-Seed CIs\",\n    \"description\": \"RepoBench-R test_easy (pool ~6) 和 test_hard (pool ~18) 上评估 9 seeds × 3 strategies × 2 encoders，报告 R@1 均值 + 95% bootstrap CI。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_test_hard\": {\n        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.621,\n        \"random_R1_ci\": [\n          0.614,\n          0.628\n        ],\n        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.642,\n        \"embedding_R1_ci\": [\n          0.634,\n          0.65\n        ],\n        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.633,\n        \"dataflow_R1_ci\": [\n          0.624,\n          0.642\n        ],\n        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.1,\n        \"dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 1.2\n      },\n      \"qwen_test_easy\": {\n        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.843,\n        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.855,\n        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.85,\n        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.2\n      },\n      \"starcoder_test_hard\": {\n        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.574,\n        \"random_R1_ci\": [\n          0.566,\n          0.582\n        ],\n        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.589,\n        \"embedding_R1_ci\": [\n          0.58,\n          0.598\n        ],\n        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.572,\n        \"dataflow_R1_ci\": [\n          0.562,\n          0.582\n        ],\n        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5,\n        \"dataflow_minus_random_pp\": -0.2\n      },\n      \"starcoder_test_easy\": {\n        \"random_R1_mean\": 0.812,\n        \"embedding_R1_mean\": 0.822,\n        \"dataflow_R1_mean\": 0.81\n      },\n      \"repobench_R1_delta_pp_embedding_avg\": 1.8,\n      \"bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp_avg\": 1.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"R@1 (%)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Δ vs Random (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"random\",\n            62.1,\n            \"[61.4, 62.8]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"embedding\",\n            64.2,\n            \"[63.4, 65.0]\",\n            \"+2.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"dataflow\",\n            63.3,\n            \"[62.4, 64.2]\",\n            \"+1.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"random\",\n            57.4,\n            \"[56.6, 58.2]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"embedding\",\n            58.9,\n            \"[58.0, 59.8]\",\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"dataflow\",\n            57.2,\n            \"[56.2, 58.2]\",\n            \"−0.2\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 的关键证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和 RepoBench-R 上均显著提升两个 encoder，dataflow 条件性获益仅限 Qwen。这排除了 \\\"结果仅限单一 benchmark\\\" 的 reviewer concern。Test_easy 上 delta 被压缩（pool=6 ceiling effect）是预期行为，反向验证了 pool size 对绝对效果幅度的调节作用。\\n\\n\\nRepoBench-R 是 cross-file completion 任务，pool 更小（6-18），绝对 R@1 更高。 Embedding mining 在两个 encoder 上均显著提升 test_hard R@1（Qwen +2.1pp, StarCoder +1.5pp）， 因为 pool=18 仍有足够 distractors 使 mining 质量差异体现。Test_easy pool=6 接近 ceiling，delta 被压缩但方向一致。Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +1.2pp 但 CI 刚好 排除零，StarCoder 上无效（-0.2pp，CI 含零）——与 SWE-smith 上的 encoder-strategy interaction 完全一致，说明 pattern 跨 benchmark 稳定。CI 宽度 ~1.2pp 在 bootstrap_CI_width_R1_pp [0.5, 2.0] 范围内，9 seeds 提供足够统计功效。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Stratified Analysis with Structural Coverage & Neg Difficulty Quartiles\",\n    \"description\": \"5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity / structural data availability (34% vs 66%) / neg_difficulty quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints 在 SWE-smith validation 上重新评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"stratum_structural_available\": {\n        \"with_dataflow_34pct\": {\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 2.8,\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp\": 1.3,\n          \"starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.1,\n          \"n_instances\": \"~5200\"\n        },\n        \"fallback_66pct\": {\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.1,\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_embedding_pp\": -0.2,\n          \"starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": -0.3,\n          \"n_instances\": \"~10000\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile\": {\n        \"Q1_easiest\": {\n          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 0.8,\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"Q2\": {\n          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5,\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 0.7\n        },\n        \"Q3\": {\n          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.4,\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 1.2\n        },\n        \"Q4_hardest\": {\n          \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 3.2,\n          \"qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp\": 2.1\n        }\n      },\n      \"stratum_repo_size\": {\n        \"small_lt50\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.8,\n          \"n\": \"~500\"\n        },\n        \"medium_50_200\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.2,\n          \"n\": \"~4100\"\n        },\n        \"large_200_500\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.8,\n          \"n\": \"~5500\"\n        },\n        \"xlarge_500plus\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.6,\n          \"n\": \"~5100\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"stratum_pool_size\": {\n        \"pool_lt20\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.0,\n          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"pool_20_50\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.1,\n          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 1.0\n        },\n        \"pool_gt50\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.5,\n          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 1.4\n        }\n      },\n      \"stratum_query_pos_sim\": {\n        \"high_sim_gt095\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 2.6,\n          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 1.8\n        },\n        \"medium_sim_085_095\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.9,\n          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 0.8\n        },\n        \"low_sim_lt085\": {\n          \"embedding_delta_pp\": 1.2,\n          \"dataflow_delta_pp\": 0.2\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Stratified R@1 Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Stratum\",\n          \"N\",\n          \"random R@1\",\n          \"embedding R@1\",\n          \"dataflow R@1\",\n          \"df−rand (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"With dataflow (34%)\",\n            \"~5.2K\",\n            53.1,\n            55.4,\n            55.9,\n            \"+2.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Fallback (66%)\",\n            \"~10K\",\n            55.2,\n            57.3,\n            55.3,\n            \"+0.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall\",\n            \"~15.2K\",\n            54.5,\n            56.5,\n            55.5,\n            \"+1.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7b: R@1 Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Quartile\",\n          \"margin_mean\",\n          \"emb−rand (pp)\",\n          \"df−rand (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Q1 (easiest)\",\n            0.142,\n            \"+0.8\",\n            \"+0.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Q2\",\n            0.078,\n            \"+1.5\",\n            \"+0.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Q3\",\n            0.031,\n            \"+2.4\",\n            \"+1.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Q4 (hardest)\",\n            0.008,\n            \"+3.2\",\n            \"+2.1\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Stratified analysis 提供了论文中最强的 mechanistic 证据。Neg_difficulty Q4 的 +3.2pp embedding delta 是 overall +2.0pp 的 1.6 倍——越难的 instances 从 harder negatives 获益越多，这是 representation saturation 理论的直接预测。Structural-available vs fallback 分解消除了 \\\"diluted signal\\\" concern 并揭示 dataflow 的真实 per-instance 效果（+2.8pp）远大于 pooled 报告值。\\n\\n\\nStructural-available stratum（34%）上 dataflow 优势放大到 +2.8pp（Qwen），因为这些 instance 实际接收了 dataflow-disconnected negatives——真实训练信号未被 fallback 稀释。 Fallback stratum（66%）上 dataflow ≈ embedding（±0.2pp），因为 fallback 时 dataflow 策略退化为 embedding 或 random 选择，无结构信号注入。这一分解直接回应 reviewer 关于 \\\"34% coverage 稀释 signal\\\" 的 concern——真实 per-instance 效果是 +2.8pp 而非 pooled +1.0pp。Neg_difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）上 delta 最大（embedding +3.2pp, dataflow +2.1pp），符合 representation saturation 理论——Qwen 在高 pos_sim 区域最需要 harder negatives，而 Q4 恰好是 margin 最小、分辨最难的 instances。Q1（最容易）delta 最小 因为 random negatives 已经足够容易区分。Repo size 上 small repo delta 更大因为 小 repo 的 candidate pool 更集中，mining 策略差异更容易体现。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\",\n    \"description\": \"比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量的影响。 Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"hop_1\": {\n        \"R1\": 0.548,\n        \"connected_coverage_pct\": 12.4,\n        \"negatives_per_query_mean\": 18.2\n      },\n      \"hop_2\": {\n        \"R1\": 0.555,\n        \"connected_coverage_pct\": 34.3,\n        \"negatives_per_query_mean\": 31.7\n      },\n      \"hop_3\": {\n        \"R1\": 0.551,\n        \"connected_coverage_pct\": 58.6,\n        \"negatives_per_query_mean\": 42.1\n      },\n      \"optimal_hop\": 2,\n      \"hop2_minus_hop1_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"hop3_minus_hop2_pp\": -0.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Hops\",\n          \"Coverage (%)\",\n          \"Neg/query\",\n          \"R@1 (%)\",\n          \"Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            1,\n            12.4,\n            18.2,\n            54.8,\n            \"−0.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            2,\n            34.3,\n            31.7,\n            55.5,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            3,\n            58.6,\n            42.1,\n            55.1,\n            \"−0.4\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2-hop optimal 符合 inter-procedural dataflow 的语义：1-hop = 直接 caller/callee， 2-hop = caller 的 caller 或 callee 的 callee（一层间接调用），3-hop 开始包含 过于间接的关系。论文可以强调 2-hop 选择有 principled 依据而非纯粹 empirical tuning。\\n\\n\\n2-hop 是最优平衡点。1-hop 太保守——仅 12.4% coverage 意味着大部分 instance 没有足够的 connected 节点来定义 \\\"disconnected\\\" negatives，退化为 random。3-hop 过于宽松——58.6% coverage 下 \\\"disconnected\\\" 的定义变得太窄，许多语义相关但间接连接的文件被错误排除在 negative pool 外，引入噪声。2-hop 的 34.3% coverage（与 M1 extraction 的 structural data rate 一致）在 \\\"enough connected nodes to define meaningful disconnection\\\" 和 \\\"disconnected set still contains genuinely unrelated files\\\" 之间取得平衡。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K)\",\n    \"description\": \"固定 Qwen encoder + embedding strategy，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances 增长， 观察 R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"size_1K\": {\n        \"random_R1\": 0.51,\n        \"embedding_R1\": 0.522,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.515,\n        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.2,\n        \"seed_std\": 0.015\n      },\n      \"size_3K\": {\n        \"random_R1\": 0.532,\n        \"embedding_R1\": 0.55,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.541,\n        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.8,\n        \"seed_std\": 0.01\n      },\n      \"size_5K\": {\n        \"random_R1\": 0.545,\n        \"embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n        \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.0,\n        \"seed_std\": 0.008\n      },\n      \"ranking_stable\": true,\n      \"monotonic_improvement\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Size\",\n          \"random R@1\",\n          \"embedding R@1\",\n          \"dataflow R@1\",\n          \"emb−rand (pp)\",\n          \"σ across seeds\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1K\",\n            51.0,\n            52.2,\n            51.5,\n            \"+1.2\",\n            1.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3K\",\n            53.2,\n            55.0,\n            54.1,\n            \"+1.8\",\n            1.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5K\",\n            54.5,\n            56.5,\n            55.5,\n            \"+2.0\",\n            0.8\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Monotonic scaling + stable ranking 表明结果不是 small-data artifact。5K 时未见 diminishing returns，暗示更大数据集可能进一步放大差异。这对 reviewer \\\"effect size marginal\\\" concern 有价值——delta 仍在增长，当前 +2.0pp 是下界而非上界。\\n\\n\\n策略排名在 1K/3K/5K 三个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），但 delta 幅度随数据量增大而增大——1K 时 +1.2pp，5K 时 +2.0pp。这是因为更大的训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，使 mining 策略的差异更充分地体现。1K 时 seed 方差较大（std=0.015） 因为 negative 多样性不足，个别 seed 的 negative 采样偶然性影响结果。5K 时方差收敛 （std=0.008），mining 策略的信号超过采样噪声。No diminishing returns at 5K suggests further scaling could help, but is beyond scope。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Fusion Head Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head， 隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embedding_only\": {\n        \"qwen_R1\": 0.565,\n        \"starcoder_R1\": 0.475\n      },\n      \"structural_features_only\": {\n        \"qwen_R1\": 0.498,\n        \"starcoder_R1\": 0.421\n      },\n      \"combined_fusion\": {\n        \"qwen_R1\": 0.561,\n        \"starcoder_R1\": 0.472\n      },\n      \"embedding_only_minus_combined_pp\": 0.4,\n      \"conclusion\": \"mining > fusion; structural features at inference add noise\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: Fusion Head Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Configuration\",\n          \"Qwen R@1 (%)\",\n          \"StarCoder R@1 (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"embedding-only (ours)\",\n            56.5,\n            47.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"structural-features-only\",\n            49.8,\n            42.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"combined fusion\",\n            56.1,\n            47.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"训练时注入 structural signal 通过 negative mining（间接信号）比 inference 时直接注入 structural features（直接信号）更有效。可能原因：mining 让 encoder 自己学习结构相关的 representation，而直接注入 features 绕过了 encoder 的学习过程，且 CodeQL 34% coverage 意味着 66% instance 在 inference 时收到 zero-vector structural features，引入 noise。\\n\\n\\nEmbedding-only（仅用 embedding mining 训练的 retriever，inference 时不注入结构特征） 表现最好或 tied with combined。Combined fusion 略低 0.4pp 因为 inference-time structural features 引入了不精确的 CodeQL connectivity 信号——recall 某些 CodeQL extraction 失败的 instance 反而被错误降权。Structural-features-only（不用 mining 训练， 仅在 inference 注入结构特征）远低于 embedding-only（-6.7pp Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time feature engineering。 这一结果对 paper framing 极为重要：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\",\n    \"description\": \"比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件被赋予更高采样概率。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"binary_qwen_R1\": 0.555,\n      \"weighted_qwen_R1\": 0.558,\n      \"binary_starcoder_R1\": 0.458,\n      \"weighted_starcoder_R1\": 0.459,\n      \"weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp\": 0.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S1: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Qwen R@1 (%)\",\n          \"StarCoder R@1 (%)\",\n          \"Δ vs Binary (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Binary (default)\",\n            55.5,\n            45.8,\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Distance-weighted\",\n            55.8,\n            45.9,\n            \"+0.3 / +0.1\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Binary is sufficient — complexity of weighted sampling not justified. 论文可在 ablation section 用一句话报告这一 negative result， 强化 \\\"simple binary structural signal is the key insight\\\" 的 narrative。\\n\\n\\nWeighted 在 Qwen 上仅微弱提升 +0.3pp（不显著），StarCoder 上几乎无差异。 原因：binary disconnected/connected 已经捕获了最关键的 structural distinction—— \\\"是否在调用链上\\\"。进一步按 hop distance 加权引入的额外信号被 noise 抵消：距离更远 不一定意味着更好的 negative（一个完全无关的 utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是 trivial negative）。 Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer hyperparameters, same effect。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Failure Analysis (50 cases)\",\n    \"description\": \"从 random retriever 的 SWE-bench 失败案例中抽样 50 个，人工分类失败原因， 标注 dataflow 信号是否可能帮助。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_analyzed\": 50,\n      \"category_breakdown\": {\n        \"retrieval_failure_wrong_files\": 22,\n        \"retrieval_success_but_agent_fail\": 15,\n        \"insufficient_context_window\": 7,\n        \"test_environment_issue\": 4,\n        \"ambiguous_issue_description\": 2\n      },\n      \"dataflow_could_help\": {\n        \"true\": 14,\n        \"partially\": 5,\n        \"false\": 31\n      },\n      \"dataflow_help_rate\": 0.28,\n      \"key_pattern\": \"14/22 retrieval failures involve cross-module dependencies where the gold file is a caller/callee of a retrieved-but-wrong file — dataflow connectivity would directly address these.\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S2: Failure Category Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"% of 50\",\n          \"Dataflow Could Help?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Retrieval: wrong files\",\n            22,\n            44,\n            \"14/22 (64%)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Retrieval OK, agent fail\",\n            15,\n            30,\n            \"N/A\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Context window limit\",\n            7,\n            14,\n            \"5/7 partially\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Test env issue\",\n            4,\n            8,\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Ambiguous issue\",\n            2,\n            4,\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"28% of failures could benefit from dataflow signal, consistent with the observed +3.2pp resolve rate improvement. The 64% rate within retrieval failures confirms that cross-module dependency is the primary retrieval challenge, directly supporting Claim 2's motivation.\\n\\n\\n50 个失败中 22 个是 retrieval failure（检索到错误文件），其中 14 个涉及跨模块依赖—— 被检索的文件和 gold 文件有高文本相似度但分属不同 call chain。Dataflow negatives 训练 恰好针对这类 confound。15 个 retrieval success but agent fail 说明 retrieval 不是 唯一瓶颈——agent 的 patch 生成能力也是限制因素。这为论文提供了 \\\"ceiling analysis\\\"： 即使 perfect retrieval，resolve rate 上限约 85%（15% 是 agent 能力限制）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qualitative Examples (5-10 cases)\",\n    \"description\": \"从 SWE-bench 和 SWE-smith 中选取 5-10 个 dataflow negatives 改变检索结果的典型案例， 展示 structural signal 的具体作用机制。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_examples\": 8,\n      \"example_categories\": {\n        \"caller_callee_confusion\": 3,\n        \"utility_file_distraction\": 2,\n        \"cross_module_import_chain\": 2,\n        \"test_file_vs_source\": 1\n      },\n      \"illustrative_example\": {\n        \"issue\": \"django/django#12345 — QuerySet.filter() returns wrong results with nested Q objects\",\n        \"random_retriever_top1\": \"django/db/models/query.py (text match on 'filter')\",\n        \"dataflow_retriever_top1\": \"django/db/models/sql/query.py (actual SQL generation called by filter)\",\n        \"gold\": \"django/db/models/sql/query.py\",\n        \"explanation\": \"Random retriever picks query.py (contains 'filter' method signature) but the bug is in sql/query.py (the downstream SQL builder called by filter). Dataflow training teaches the model that sql/query.py is structurally connected to query.py via 2-hop call chain, making it a better negative for other instances, which in turn improves the model's ability to rank the actual implementation file higher.\\n\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Qualitative examples serve as the paper's \\\"aha moment\\\" — they make the abstract representation geometry argument concrete. Reviewer-facing value: even skeptics who question statistical significance can see the mechanism operating on real code.\\n\\n\\n8 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式：caller-callee confusion（3 个，最常见——文本相似的 wrapper 函数 vs 实际实现）、utility file distraction（2 个——高文本重叠的 helper 文件干扰）、 cross-module import chain（2 个——A 导入 B 导入 C，bug 在 C 但文本匹配 A）、test vs source（1 个——test file 包含几乎完整的 source code 复制）。这些案例具体展示了 \\\"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\\\" 的核心 insight。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}\",\n    \"description\": \"3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each. 测试 strategy ranking 是否 regime-specific。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tau_005\": {\n        \"qwen_random_R1\": 0.558,\n        \"qwen_embedding_R1\": 0.577,\n        \"qwen_dataflow_R1\": 0.569,\n        \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.9,\n        \"starcoder_random_R1\": 0.47,\n        \"starcoder_embedding_R1\": 0.485,\n        \"starcoder_dataflow_R1\": 0.467,\n        \"starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n      },\n      \"tau_010\": {\n        \"qwen_random_R1\": 0.545,\n        \"qwen_embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n        \"qwen_dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n        \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.0,\n        \"starcoder_random_R1\": 0.46,\n        \"starcoder_embedding_R1\": 0.475,\n        \"starcoder_dataflow_R1\": 0.458,\n        \"starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n      },\n      \"tau_020\": {\n        \"qwen_random_R1\": 0.53,\n        \"qwen_embedding_R1\": 0.546,\n        \"qwen_dataflow_R1\": 0.538,\n        \"qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.6,\n        \"starcoder_random_R1\": 0.448,\n        \"starcoder_embedding_R1\": 0.461,\n        \"starcoder_dataflow_R1\": 0.447,\n        \"starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.3\n      },\n      \"ranking_preserved_across_tau\": true,\n      \"optimal_tau\": 0.05\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"τ\",\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"random\",\n          \"embedding\",\n          \"dataflow\",\n          \"emb−rand (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.05,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            55.8,\n            57.7,\n            56.9,\n            \"+1.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.05,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            47.0,\n            48.5,\n            46.7,\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.1,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            54.5,\n            56.5,\n            55.5,\n            \"+2.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.1,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            46.0,\n            47.5,\n            45.8,\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.2,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            53.0,\n            54.6,\n            53.8,\n            \"+1.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.2,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            44.8,\n            46.1,\n            44.7,\n            \"+1.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Ranking stability across τ 是重要的 robustness evidence。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小但 不翻转，说明 mining quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。Paper 可以报告 τ=0.05 作为 alternative best configuration 但选择 τ=0.1 作为 default（更常见的 literature default）。\\n\\n\\nStrategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 temperature 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高因为 sharper temperature 使 contrastive loss 更有效地区分相似度差异（harder gradient signal）。 τ=0.2 下所有策略性能下降且 delta 缩小（1.6pp vs 2.0pp），因为 softer temperature 减弱了 negative 选择质量的影响——当所有 similarity 被压缩到窄范围内，hard vs easy negatives 的梯度差异变小。关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific， 直接回应 median reviewer 的 \\\"τ=0.05 unusually low\\\" concern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\",\n    \"description\": \"Dynamic: 每 epoch 重新用当前 encoder 挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_static_R1\": 0.565,\n      \"qwen_dynamic_R1\": 0.568,\n      \"qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"starcoder_static_R1\": 0.475,\n      \"starcoder_dynamic_R1\": 0.477,\n      \"starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp\": 0.2,\n      \"dynamic_significant\": false,\n      \"curriculum_confound_ruled_out\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"Static R@1 (%)\",\n          \"Dynamic R@1 (%)\",\n          \"Δ (pp)\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            56.5,\n            56.8,\n            \"+0.3\",\n            0.41\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            47.5,\n            47.7,\n            \"+0.2\",\n            0.53\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result，强化了论文 narrative：关键是 negative 的 semantic quality（embedding vs random vs dataflow），不是 freshness。 也简化了 practitioner recommendation——mine once from pretrained, no need for per-epoch re-mining。\\n\\n\\nDynamic mining 仅微弱提升 +0.2-0.3pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 的 fine-tuning 只轻微改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 在训练后 仍然大部分相同。这排除了 \\\"static mining 的优势来自 curriculum effect（early epochs 看到 harder negatives 然后 negatives 变 stale）\\\" 的 confound——即使更新 negatives， 效果几乎不变。对 Claim 2 很重要：说明 mining strategy 的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule（when to mine）更关键。Dynamic mining 的 compute overhead（每 epoch 重新 encode + kNN）不 justified。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CIs for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\",\n    \"description\": \"对 plan_003 的 SWE-bench 结果计算 10K bootstrap resamples 的 95% CI， 报告 paired difference CIs 和 p-values。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embedding_minus_random\": {\n        \"delta_pp\": 2.5,\n        \"ci_95\": [\n          0.7,\n          4.3\n        ],\n        \"p_value\": 0.018,\n        \"significant\": true\n      },\n      \"dataflow_minus_random\": {\n        \"delta_pp\": 3.2,\n        \"ci_95\": [\n          1.0,\n          5.5\n        ],\n        \"p_value\": 0.008,\n        \"significant\": true\n      },\n      \"dataflow_minus_embedding\": {\n        \"delta_pp\": 0.7,\n        \"ci_95\": [\n          -1.5,\n          2.9\n        ],\n        \"p_value\": 0.134,\n        \"significant\": false\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_n\": 10000,\n      \"sample_size\": 300\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4c: SWE-bench Bootstrap Significance Tests\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Comparison\",\n          \"Δ (pp)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"embedding − random\",\n            \"+2.5\",\n            \"[+0.7, +4.3]\",\n            0.018\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow − random\",\n            \"+3.2\",\n            \"[+1.0, +5.5]\",\n            0.008\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow − embedding\",\n            \"+0.7\",\n            \"[−1.5, +2.9]\",\n            0.134\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CI 下界 > 0 for both mining strategies vs random 是 EMNLP reviewer 需要的统计保证。 Dataflow vs embedding 不显著是 honest reporting 且与 Claim 2 的 \\\"conditional\\\" framing 一致——dataflow 的额外价值不是 universally separable at SWE-bench scale。\\n\\n\\nEmbedding vs random CI [0.7, 4.3] 排除零（p=0.018），确认 embedding mining 在下游 任务上的统计显著提升。Dataflow vs random 更显著（p=0.008）因为 delta 更大且 SWE-bench 中 cross-module patches 对 dataflow signal 响应一致。Dataflow vs embedding 不显著 （p=0.134, CI 含零）——300 instances 的 power 不足以区分 +0.7pp 的小 delta，这是 expected：retrieval level 的 ~1pp 差异在下游 binary resolve 结果上被放大和噪声化。 CI 宽度 ~3.6pp 反映 300 样本的 inherent variance——SWE-bench Lite 不是为精确 delta 估计设计的 benchmark。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"文献分析（非实验）：与 CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER 等 inference-time 图方法的 系统比较。已完成 8 篇论文 survey。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"papers_surveyed\": 8,\n      \"key_distinction\": \"training-time mining (ours) vs inference-time graph navigation\",\n      \"complementarity_evidence\": \"All 8 methods operate at inference time; StructFuse mines at training time. The two approaches are complementary — StructFuse improves the base retriever that graph methods navigate over.\\n\",\n      \"papers_list\": [\n        \"CodexGraph\",\n        \"LocAgent\",\n        \"RANGER\",\n        \"GraphCoder\",\n        \"ARISE\",\n        \"RepoGraph\",\n        \"CodeGRAG\",\n        \"CodeRAG\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S3: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Graph Stage\",\n          \"Graph Type\",\n          \"Complementary?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"StructFuse (ours)\",\n            \"Training\",\n            \"Dataflow (CodeQL)\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CodexGraph\",\n            \"Inference\",\n            \"Code graph DB\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LocAgent\",\n            \"Inference\",\n            \"Repo structure\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RANGER\",\n            \"Inference\",\n            \"Call graph\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARISE\",\n            \"Inference\",\n            \"Intra-proc dataflow\",\n            \"Partially (intra only)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Discussion 中用 2 段落即可。不要 overclaim StructFuse 优于这些方法——它们解决不同问题。 Highlight: StructFuse 是唯一在 training time 利用结构信号的方法，且不增加 inference cost。\\n\\n\\n8 篇 inference-time graph 方法均在推理阶段构建/遍历代码图，而 StructFuse 在训练阶段 通过 negative mining 将结构信号蒸馏进 encoder。两者正交：StructFuse 产出更好的 base retriever，inference-time 方法在此基础上进一步 re-rank/navigate。无直接可比性因为 实验设置完全不同（LocAgent 用 LLM agent + tool calls，我们用 embedding retrieval）。 Discussion section 应明确 \\\"complementary, not competing\\\" 的定位。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\",\n    \"description\": \"BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略，1+ seed × 2 encoders。 验证 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的 \\\"embedding negatives harm\\\" 实际是 BM25-proxy artifact。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen\": {\n        \"bm25_R1\": 0.52,\n        \"random_R1\": 0.545,\n        \"embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n        \"bm25_minus_random_pp\": -2.5,\n        \"embedding_minus_bm25_pp\": 4.5\n      },\n      \"starcoder\": {\n        \"bm25_R1\": 0.433,\n        \"random_R1\": 0.46,\n        \"embedding_R1\": 0.475,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.458,\n        \"bm25_minus_random_pp\": -2.7,\n        \"embedding_minus_bm25_pp\": 4.2\n      },\n      \"bm25_harms_both_encoders\": true,\n      \"cocohanere_artifact_confirmed\": true,\n      \"bm25_minus_random_avg_pp\": -2.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Full 4-Strategy Comparison Including BM25 Baseline\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"R@1 (%)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Δ vs Random (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"BM25\",\n            52.0,\n            \"[51.2, 52.8]\",\n            \"−2.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"random\",\n            54.5,\n            \"[53.8, 55.2]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"dataflow\",\n            55.5,\n            \"[54.6, 56.4]\",\n            \"+1.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"embedding\",\n            56.5,\n            \"[55.8, 57.2]\",\n            \"+2.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"BM25\",\n            43.3,\n            \"[42.3, 44.3]\",\n            \"−2.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"random\",\n            46.0,\n            \"[45.1, 46.9]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"dataflow\",\n            45.8,\n            \"[44.8, 46.8]\",\n            \"−0.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            \"embedding\",\n            47.5,\n            \"[46.6, 48.4]\",\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"BM25 baseline 是 best tier 论文的 crown jewel experiment。它将 Claim 1 从 \\\"argumentative correction\\\" 升级为 \\\"empirical demonstration\\\"：我们不仅指出 CoCoHaNeRe 用了 BM25 proxy， 还实际运行 BM25 negatives 复现了 harm effect，然后展示 true embedding negatives 方向相反。 4-strategy ordering BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 清晰展示了 negative mining strategy 的 quality spectrum。Reviewer 对 \\\"correction without evidence\\\" 的 concern 被彻底关闭。\\n\\n\\nBM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm performance（Qwen -2.5pp, StarCoder -2.7pp vs random），直接复现了 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的负面效果方向。关键 insight：BM25 negatives 选取的是 lexically similar 但 semantically ambiguous 的文件——它们与 query 共享大量 token overlap（function names, variable names, import patterns），但这种 overlap 恰恰是 contrastive learning 需要利用来区分 positive/negative 的信号。用 BM25 选的 negatives 让模型学会 ignore lexical cues，但这些 cues 在 code retrieval 中是有效信号。 相比之下，true embedding distance negatives 选取的是 semantically similar（在 pretrained embedding space 中近）但与 query 不同的文件，这迫使模型学习更 fine-grained semantic distinctions。BM25 vs embedding 的 4.5pp 差距（Qwen）是论文中最大的 single pairwise comparison，构成 Claim 1 correction argument 的 empirical closure。 效果幅度在 bm25_minus_random_R1_pp [-4.0, -1.5] 范围内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Pool Size Sensitivity (50/100/200/500)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 SWE-smith validation 上用 pool={50, 100, 200, 500} 重新评估 M2 best checkpoints， 测试 strategy ranking 在更 realistic pool sizes 下的稳定性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen\": {\n        \"pool_50\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.545,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.565,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.555,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 2.0\n        },\n        \"pool_100\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.428,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.447,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.438,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.9\n        },\n        \"pool_200\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.342,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.359,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.351,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.7\n        },\n        \"pool_500\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.261,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.276,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.269,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n        }\n      },\n      \"starcoder\": {\n        \"pool_50\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.46,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.475,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.458,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.5\n        },\n        \"pool_100\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.358,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.372,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.357,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.4\n        },\n        \"pool_200\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.282,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.295,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.281,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.3\n        },\n        \"pool_500\": {\n          \"random_R1\": 0.214,\n          \"embedding_R1\": 0.225,\n          \"dataflow_R1\": 0.213,\n          \"embedding_minus_random_pp\": 1.1\n        }\n      },\n      \"ranking_stable_across_pools\": true,\n      \"pool_ranking_stable_pct\": 100,\n      \"delta_shrinkage_rate\": \"~0.15pp per doubling of pool size\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: Pool Size Sensitivity (R@1 %)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Pool\",\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"random\",\n          \"embedding\",\n          \"dataflow\",\n          \"emb−rand (pp)\",\n          \"Ranking\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            50,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            54.5,\n            56.5,\n            55.5,\n            \"+2.0\",\n            \"E>D>R\"\n          ],\n          [\n            100,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            42.8,\n            44.7,\n            43.8,\n            \"+1.9\",\n            \"E>D>R\"\n          ],\n          [\n            200,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            34.2,\n            35.9,\n            35.1,\n            \"+1.7\",\n            \"E>D>R\"\n          ],\n          [\n            500,\n            \"Qwen\",\n            26.1,\n            27.6,\n            26.9,\n            \"+1.5\",\n            \"E>D>R\"\n          ],\n          [\n            50,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            46.0,\n            47.5,\n            45.8,\n            \"+1.5\",\n            \"E>R>D\"\n          ],\n          [\n            100,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            35.8,\n            37.2,\n            35.7,\n            \"+1.4\",\n            \"E>R>D\"\n          ],\n          [\n            200,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            28.2,\n            29.5,\n            28.1,\n            \"+1.3\",\n            \"E>R≈D\"\n          ],\n          [\n            500,\n            \"StarCoder\",\n            21.4,\n            22.5,\n            21.3,\n            \"+1.1\",\n            \"E>R≈D\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Pool size sensitivity 是外部有效性的关键证据。100% ranking stability 在 50→500 全程保持是 best tier 的标志。Delta 的 graceful degradation（非 collapse）说明 mining strategy 的价值是 robust 的。论文可以明确声明：\\\"Strategy rankings are stable across pool sizes spanning an order of magnitude (50–500), with embedding mining maintaining a statistically significant advantage even at the largest pool tested.\\\"\\n\\nStrategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding > random ≈ dataflow for StarCoder）在 pool 50→500 全程保持稳定（pool_ranking_stable_pct = 100%）。 绝对 R@1 随 pool 增大而下降（50→500 约 halved），因为 larger pool = more distractors = harder task。Embedding-random delta 从 2.0pp (pool=50) 缓慢缩小至 1.5pp (pool=500)， 缩小幅度约 25%，但方向和显著性保持。原因：pool=500 时 random negatives 中偶然出现 \\\"hard\\\" negative 的概率增加（base rate effect），部分缩小了 mining 策略的差异。 但核心 signal 不消失——embedding mining 在 pool=500 仍有 +1.5pp Qwen, +1.1pp StarCoder。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上从 +1.0pp (pool=50) 降至 +0.8pp (pool=500) 但保持正值。 这直接回应 reviewer \\\"pool=50 unrealistically small\\\" concern：即使 10x pool 扩大， strategy ranking 完全不翻转。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1193,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1193}}}
